    rationale: `DSM-5-TR requires that binge eating and inappropriate compensatory behaviors such as vomiting, laxative misuse, fasting or excessive exercise both occur, on average, at least once a week for 3 months. DSM-IV had required twice weekly. Binge-eating disorder uses the same once-a-week for 3 months threshold for binge episodes.`,
